## 3. TYPOGRAPHY

Import these Google Fonts at the top of the CSS (or in the `<head>`):

```html
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;0,900;1,700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

Define font stack variables:
```css
:root {
  --font-serif: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
  --font-mono:  'IBM Plex Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
  --font-sans:  'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
}
```

### Font Usage Rules

| Element | Font | Weight | Style Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `body` | `var(--font-sans)` | 300–400 | Base reading text |
| H1 (name/hero title) | `var(--font-serif)` | 900 | Large, editorial. Mix roman + italic lines |
| H2 (section titles) | `var(--font-serif)` | 700 | Italic preferred |
| H3 (card/item titles) | `var(--font-sans)` | 500 | Slightly heavier than body |
| Nav links | `var(--font-mono)` | 400 | Uppercase, `letter-spacing: 0.1em`, `font-size: 0.72rem` |
| Nav logo | `var(--font-mono)` | 500 | Uppercase, forest green |
| Tags / labels / badges | `var(--font-mono)` | 400 | Uppercase, `font-size: 0.65rem`, `letter-spacing: 0.12em` |
| Button text | `var(--font-mono)` | 500 | Uppercase, `letter-spacing: 0.12em` |
| Metadata / dates / captions | `var(--font-mono)` | 300 | Muted color, small size |
| Code / terminal blocks | `var(--font-mono)` | 400 | — |

### Type Colors
- Headings: `var(--forest)`
- Body text: `var(--ink)`
- Muted/secondary text: `var(--ink-muted)`
- Accent text (keywords, highlights): `var(--sienna)`
- Mono labels & tags: `var(--ink)` at 55% opacity, or `var(--sienna)` for active/highlighted
- Links: `var(--forest)`, underline on hover using `var(--sienna)`

