## 12. ANIMATIONS & TRANSITIONS

### Page Load — Staggered Reveal
Apply this to every major section/block element with increasing `animation-delay`:
```css
@keyframes fadeUp {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.animate-in {
  animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
}
```
Use `animation-delay` increments of `0.15s` for sequential elements (0.1s, 0.25s, 0.4s, 0.55s...).

### Hover Transitions
- All interactive elements: `transition: all 0.2s ease` or broken into specific properties for performance
- Card hover: hard offset shadow (no gaussian blur) — `box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--sienna)`
- Button hover: `transform: translate(-2px, -2px)` + same hard shadow

### Blinking Cursor
```css
@keyframes blink {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50%       { opacity: 0; }
}
```

