## 15. SPACING SYSTEM

Use an 8pt base grid. Key spacing values:
- `0.5rem` = 8px (tight inline gap)
- `1rem` = 16px (standard gap)
- `1.5rem` = 24px (element spacing)
- `2.5rem` = 40px (section internal padding)
- `4rem` = 64px (page horizontal padding)
- `6rem` = 96px (section vertical padding)

Section padding: `padding: 6rem 4rem`
Container max-width: `1280px`, centered with `margin: 0 auto`

